==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|t|i}}

===Etymology===
From the verb {{suffix|tietää|gloss1=to know|o|lang=fi}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ieto|lang=fi}}
* {{IPA|[ˈt̪ie̞t̪o̞]|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|tie|to}}
* {{rhymes|eto|lang=fi}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia|lang=fi}}
{{head|fi|noun}}

# [[knowledge]]
#: '''tietomme''' fysiikasta
#:: our knowledge about physics
# [[data]]
#: Olen kerännyt tästä yrityksestä paljon '''tietoa'''.
#:: I have collected lots of data on this company.
# [[information]]
#: Elämme '''tieto'''yhteiskunnassa.
#:: We live in an information society.
# [[notice]]
#: Sain '''tiedon''' onnettomuudesta tänä aamuna.
#:: I got a notice of the accident on this morning.
# [[intelligence]]
#: Saimme vangeilta '''tietoa''' vihollisesta.
#:: We gathered intelligence of the enemy from the prisoners.

